 - Timestamps on each exchange.
 - Clear history with confirmation dialog.

+### Conversation Export
+- 'Export conversation' button in the question panel (always enabled, does not ask a question).
+- Saves the whole conversation as Markdown to a file chosen in a save dialog (default name `conversation-YYYY-MM-DD.md`).
+- Each question numbered (`## Question N`) with its answer and citations (document title and quoted excerpt); an empty conversation exports "No questions yet."
+- Shows the saved path on success, an error if the file cannot be written, nothing on cancel.
+- Also available as `window.knowledgeBase.conversation.export()` (returns the Markdown string).
+
 ### Feedback Collection
 - Thumbs up/down buttons on each Q&A response in conversation history.
 - Thumbs up/down buttons on the latest response in document view.
